      "text": "During construction, routes to the Central Library through Main Building floors 1–3, its third-floor rear entrance, and Outdoor Parking Lot A are closed and should not be suggested. The designated accessible alternative runs from Parking Lot C through the Student Centre accessible entrance to the library’s official west entrance; the Student Centre accessible restroom route is left from the Main Building. Outdoor redirection may impose substantial summer heat and travel burdens, and mobility companions may reconfirm distance and slope."
